{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321321001:1":{"text":"格、格尔达女士，这些是您从瓦迪姆老板那里订的食材。对了，还有这份货物清单——！","source_cn":"格、格尔达女士，这些是您从瓦迪姆老板那里订的食材。对了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653FB8A39AB64A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321321002:1":{"text":"瓦迪姆手上的食材种类倒是很齐全，真不愧是雪松镇最靠谱的商人。","source_cn":"瓦迪姆手上的食材种类倒是很齐全，真不愧是雪松镇最靠谱的商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96C6AACA4F4E47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321321003:1":{"text":"……嗯？怎么有一些和我订的数量对不上？是我记错了吗？","source_cn":"……嗯？怎么有一些和我订的数量对不上？是我记错了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F966D934EF47D88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321321004:1":{"text":"是……是这样的，瓦迪姆老板派人找遍了公国，但暂时只能采购到这些数量的食材。其他的要么是不够新鲜，要么就是坐地起价，老板不想抬高您的成本……","source_cn":"是……是这样的，瓦迪姆老板派人找遍了公国，但暂时只能采...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD717C0761328F682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321321005:1":{"text":"不过您放心，瓦迪姆老板过几天一定会补上这些缺口！这是他亲口保证的……！","source_cn":"不过您放心，瓦迪姆老板过几天一定会补上这些缺口！这是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14AE355874740CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321321006:1":{"text":"唉……这也不能怪你们，暂时这样吧。","source_cn":"唉……这也不能怪你们，暂时这样吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16A42AD327986830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321321007:1":{"text":"对了，格尔达女士，你的鱼怎么样了？有没有能适应温泉环境的？","source_cn":"对了，格尔达女士，你的鱼怎么样了？有没有能适应温泉环境的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA432AE14778380D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321321008:1":{"text":"亲爱的，在这方面有两个好消息，也有一个坏消息。","source_cn":"亲爱的，在这方面有两个好消息，也有一个坏消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E75EDFB11650E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321321009:1":{"text":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是——这两种鱼刚好是冰猫鱼和香脂鲱，作为食材最受欢迎的巴巴虾却没办法适应温泉。","source_cn":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4A0ACE76BC07AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1321321009":{"text":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是——这两种鱼刚好是冰猫鱼和香脂鲱，作为食材最受欢迎的巴巴虾却没办法适应温泉。","source_cn":"其中一个好消息是，有两种鱼能在温泉中存活。坏消息则是——这两种鱼刚好是冰猫鱼和香脂鲱，作为食材最受欢迎的巴巴虾却没办法适应温泉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4A0ACE76BC07AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321321010:2":{"text":"我记得，巴巴虾是白山公国最出名的美食之一，味道鲜美，还可以生食呢。","source_cn":"我记得，巴巴虾是白山公国最出名的美食之一，味道鲜美，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF7ACA8D7394F30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321321011:1":{"text":"——什么？！那满满这次岂不是吃不到了？！","source_cn":"——什么？！那满满这次岂不是吃不到了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED896626389756F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321321012:1":{"text":"别担心，亲爱的。还有另一个好消息呢。","source_cn":"别担心，亲爱的。还有另一个好消息呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2FCD9241C07E274","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321321013:1":{"text":"我发现，温泉水可以激发香脂鲱的腺体，让它散发出更浓郁的香气。","source_cn":"我发现，温泉水可以激发香脂鲱的腺体，让它散发出更浓郁的香气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC955470A0FFE06EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321321014:1":{"text":"所以，我想试着用香脂鲱研发一道新菜，看看味道和卖相如何，能不能拿来招待客人。","source_cn":"所以，我想试着用香脂鲱研发一道新菜，看看味道和卖相如何...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF21B46CFE6C8CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_t